<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Appendix</h2>

<section id="A1.SSx1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection">Example of ACE Framework for Kubernetes</h3>

<div id="A1.SSx1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SSx1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Enrichment of a sample Kubernetes OAS <span id="A1.SSx1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">deleteCoreV1NamespacedLimitRange</span> for a parameter is shown in Figure <a href="#A1.F4" title="Figure 4 ‣ Example of ACE Framework for Kubernetes ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Automated Creation and Enrichment Framework for Improved Invocation of Enterprise APIs as Tools" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a>. It depicts how the tool description, parameter description text is enriched and examples are added. The tools created for different variants from the enriched OAS is shown below. As shown in Figure <a href="#A1.F5" title="Figure 5 ‣ Example of ACE Framework for Kubernetes ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Automated Creation and Enrichment Framework for Improved Invocation of Enterprise APIs as Tools" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a>, in Enrich-1, only the enriched tool description is presented in the docstring. As shown in Figure <a href="#A1.F5" title="Figure 5 ‣ Example of ACE Framework for Kubernetes ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Automated Creation and Enrichment Framework for Improved Invocation of Enterprise APIs as Tools" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a>, in Enrich-2, the enriched tool description along with enriched parameter description is presented in the docstring. As shown in Figure <a href="#A1.F5" title="Figure 5 ‣ Example of ACE Framework for Kubernetes ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Automated Creation and Enrichment Framework for Improved Invocation of Enterprise APIs as Tools" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a>, in Enrich-3, the enriched tool description, parameter description and examples are presented in the docstring.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.F3" class="ltx_figure">
<p id="A1.F3.1" class="ltx_p">

<span id="A1.F3.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_middle ltx_framed ltx_framed_rectangle" style="width:227.7pt;">
<span id="A1.F3.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.F3.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">NL Utterance:</span> “Create a brand new endpoints resource of kind service in the namespace dev-1 by sending a POST request to the Kubernetes API. Use v1 api.”</span>
<span id="A1.F3.1.1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.F3.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Payload w/o enrichment</span>:</span>
<span id="A1.F3.1.1.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.F3.1.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">{‘dryRun’: ‘null’, ‘fieldManager’: ‘null’, ‘fieldValidation’: ‘null’, ‘namespace’: ‘dev-1’, ‘requestBody’: ‘{"apiVersion": "v1", "kind": "Endpoints"}’}
<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break"></span><span id="A1.F3.1.1.3.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Enriched Payload</span>:</span>
<span id="A1.F3.1.1.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.F3.1.1.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#008080;">{’dryRun’: None, ’fieldManager’: None, ’fieldValidation’: None, ’namespace’: ’dev-1’, ’requestBody’: {’apiVersion’: ’v1’, ’kind’: ’Service’}}</span></span>
</span></p>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 3: </span>Kubernetes Payload Example</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A1.F4" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2509.11626v1/noenrich-enrich3-single.png" id="A1.F4.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:698/334;" width="698" height="334" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 4: </span>Enrichment of Kubernetes OAS</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A1.F5" class="ltx_figure">
<div id="A1.F5.1" class="ltx_listing ltx_lstlisting ltx_align_center ltx_listing"><div class="ltx_listing_data"><a href="data:text/plain;base64," download="">⬇</a></div>
<div id="lstnumberx1" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#008000;">import<span id="lstnumberx1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_medium" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;">json</span></span>
</div>
<div id="lstnumberx2" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#008000;">import<span id="lstnumberx2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_medium" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx2.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;">requests</span></span>
</div>
<div id="lstnumberx3" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#008000;">from<span id="lstnumberx3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_medium" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx3.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;">typing<span id="lstnumberx3.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_medium" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span></span>import<span id="lstnumberx3.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_medium" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span></span><span id="lstnumberx3.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#666666;">*</span>
</div>
<div id="lstnumberx4" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#008000;">from<span id="lstnumberx4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_medium" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx4.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;">langchain_core.tools<span id="lstnumberx4.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_medium" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span></span>import<span id="lstnumberx4.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_medium" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span></span>tool
</div>
<div id="lstnumberx5" class="ltx_listingline">
</div>
<div id="lstnumberx6" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx6.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#AB21FF;">@tool</span>
</div>
<div id="lstnumberx7" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx7.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#008000;">def<span id="lstnumberx7.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_medium" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span></span><span id="lstnumberx7.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;">deleteCoreV1NamespacedLimitRange</span>(namespace:<span id="lstnumberx7.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span><span id="lstnumberx7.4" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#008000;">str</span>,<span id="lstnumberx7.5" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>name:<span id="lstnumberx7.6" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span><span id="lstnumberx7.7" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#008000;">str</span>,<span id="lstnumberx7.8" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>dryRun:<span id="lstnumberx7.9" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>Optional[<span id="lstnumberx7.10" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#008000;">str</span>]<span id="lstnumberx7.11" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span><span id="lstnumberx7.12" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#666666;">=<span id="lstnumberx7.12.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx7.12.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#008000;">None</span></span>,<span id="lstnumberx7.13" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>gracePeriodSeconds:<span id="lstnumberx7.14" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>Optional[<span id="lstnumberx7.15" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#008000;">int</span>]<span id="lstnumberx7.16" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span><span id="lstnumberx7.17" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#666666;">=<span id="lstnumberx7.17.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx7.17.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#008000;">None</span></span>,<span id="lstnumberx7.18" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>orphanDepend