<div id="lstnumberx61" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx61.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_italic" style="--ltx-fg-color:#BA2121;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx61.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="--ltx-fg-color:#BA2121;">:param<span id="lstnumberx61.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>propagationPolicy:<span id="lstnumberx61.2.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>Specifies<span id="lstnumberx61.2.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>the<span id="lstnumberx61.2.4" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>garbage<span id="lstnumberx61.2.5" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>collection<span id="lstnumberx61.2.6" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>policy<span id="lstnumberx61.2.7" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>for<span id="lstnumberx61.2.8" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>the<span id="lstnumberx61.2.9" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>limit<span id="lstnumberx61.2.10" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>range.<span id="lstnumberx61.2.11" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>Determines<span id="lstnumberx61.2.12" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>whether<span id="lstnumberx61.2.13" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>and<span id="lstnumberx61.2.14" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>how<span id="lstnumberx61.2.15" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>dependent<span id="lstnumberx61.2.16" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>resources<span id="lstnumberx61.2.17" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>will<span id="lstnumberx61.2.18" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>be<span id="lstnumberx61.2.19" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>deleted.<span id="lstnumberx61.2.20" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>Acceptable<span id="lstnumberx61.2.21" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>values<span id="lstnumberx61.2.22" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>are:<span id="lstnumberx61.2.23" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>’Orphan’<span id="lstnumberx61.2.24" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>-<span id="lstnumberx61.2.25" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>orphan<span id="lstnumberx61.2.26" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>the<span id="lstnumberx61.2.27" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>dependents;<span id="lstnumberx61.2.28" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>’Background’<span id="lstnumberx61.2.29" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>-<span id="lstnumberx61.2.30" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>delete<span id="lstnumberx61.2.31" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>dependents<span id="lstnumberx61.2.32" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>in<span id="lstnumberx61.2.33" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>the<span id="lstnumberx61.2.34" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>background;<span id="lstnumberx61.2.35" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>’Foreground’<span id="lstnumberx61.2.36" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>-<span id="lstnumberx61.2.37" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>delete<span id="lstnumberx61.2.38" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>all<span id="lstnumberx61.2.39" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>dependents<span id="lstnumberx61.2.40" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>in<span id="lstnumberx61.2.41" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>the<span id="lstnumberx61.2.42" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>foreground.<span id="lstnumberx61.2.43" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>Only<span id="lstnumberx61.2.44" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>one<span id="lstnumberx61.2.45" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>of<span id="lstnumberx61.2.46" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>this<span id="lstnumberx61.2.47" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>field<span id="lstnumberx61.2.48" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>or<span id="lstnumberx61.2.49" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>OrphanDependents<span id="lstnumberx61.2.50" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>can<span id="lstnumberx61.2.51" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>be<span id="lstnumberx61.2.52" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>set.</span>
